\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2713 TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"darkgreen\"><mi>✓</mi></mstyle></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I, II and IV only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
